  "Protect the hero campaigns through the rest of the season. No sudden cuts.",
  "Run a controlled, stepped Top of Search reduction on terms where we already rank #1 organically. One campaign at a time, with rank watched daily.",
  "Build separate campaigns for generic “fly” demand with their own bids, and negate electric / UV / zapper terms that are not our product.",
